  "private_abba": {
    "test": "One fresh private pair of 1500-MTU TAPs per trial, 75 us per frame, 128 ordered requests and deterministic replies, perf trace on ordinary test server and relay plus the private NAPI task where present. Confirmed MSS 1448 and SO_INCOMING_CPU 9. Same single remote CPU15 used for injector and client in the tiny test.",
